// TEST: Shared signature variable taught two array element types (rejects)
// ERROR: BL3999
// ERROR-CONTAINS: must agree EXACTLY
// ============================================================================
// A Float64 array then an Int64 array into one `T^1`: arguments sharing a
// variable agree exactly (formalism 2.4; this was BL3001 from the call
